00:10:48,440 --> 00:10:53,340
Simply put, adaptability is a skill employers are increasingly looking for.

122
00:10:54,060 --> 00:10:58,400
When you spend time learning a new task rather than resisting it, your productivity

123
00:10:58,400 --> 00:11:04,140
goes up. can also serve as an example to your co -workers who may be having trouble

124
00:11:04,140 --> 00:11:07,600
